# Keep every text file LF in the working tree on every platform. The generator,
# the email presentation compiler and the test suites compare generated text
# byte for byte, and Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true were rewriting
# hundreds of files to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
